            <div class="terminal-footer-hints">
              <span class="hint-pill"><code>new-site</code> → website / redesign</span>
              <span class="hint-pill"><code>debug</code> → fixes &amp; issues</span>
              <span class="hint-pill"><code>maintain</code> → care plans</span>
              <span class="hint-pill"><code>evolve</code> → new features</span>
